        <h1><a href="/">The Baseball Chronicle</a></h1>
        <h2><span class="entryprev"><a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/50_years_a_cubs_fan_part_three" title="Previous story">&#8592;</a></span> <a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/essays/">Essays</a>, August 2009 <span class="entrynext"><a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/fiction/the_real_baseball_hall_of_fame" title="Next story">&#8594;</a></span</h2>
